    <briefdescription>
<para>Thread-safety guarantee for <ref refid="classthemis_1_1process_1_1_process_model_manager" kindref="compound">ProcessModelManager</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><bold>Pattern:</bold> SNAPSHOT_ISOLATION <linebreak/>
 <bold>Atomicity:</bold> SINGLE_ENTITY (one model operation at a time) <linebreak/>
 <bold>Conflict Resolution:</bold> LAST_WRITE_WINS (version clock ordering)</para>
<para>Multiple threads may call create/retrieve/update/delete on different models concurrently. Concurrent updates to the <bold>same model</bold> use LWW conflict resolution with monotonic version clocks.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="invariant"><para>Concurrent retrieve() calls return consistent snapshots. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>Concurrent update() calls are serialized via version clock. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>Version numbers form a total order (no ties). </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="invariant"><para>No write-write transactions or rollback. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
